The full text of the GNU General Public License v3.0 will be vendored here
once the license choice is confirmed. See https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt
for the canonical text in the meantime.

Branding assets in branding/ (wallpapers, logos, theme bundles) are
released under CC-BY-SA-4.0 unless explicitly marked otherwise inside
that directory.

Rationale for GPL-3.0-or-later:
- Matches the license posture of much of the upstream KDE/openSUSE stack
  we depend on, so derivative work doesn't trip on incompatibility.
- Copyleft aligns with the sovereignty pitch: forks must stay open.
- "or-later" leaves room to adopt GPL-4 if and when it exists, without
  re-contacting every contributor.

This is a stub pending explicit confirmation from the project lead.
